WEBVTT

00:00:33.740 --> 00:00:36.650
<i>He will awaken on that summer hill</i>

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:38.490
<i>upon which dawn breaks with its crimson rays of light.</i>

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:41.410
<i>I will not be there.</i>

00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:43.200
<i>I must not be there.</i>

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:45.910
<i>Without even seeing his face</i>

00:00:45.910 --> 00:00:47.460
<i>nor bidding him farewell...</i>

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:50.460
<i>With only the love that wells up in my heart,</i>

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:52.460
<i>I will go far away...</i>

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:02.260
<i>Bearing regret like an infernal flame in my heart,</i>

00:01:02.260 --> 00:01:04.180
<i>beyond the darkness...</i>

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:14.940
I see.

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:18.820
When you ascend Tokyo Tower, you can't see it.

00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:19.910
I learned this for the first time.

00:01:21.950 --> 00:01:24.080
Tokyo is pretty, isn't it...

00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:29.330
<i>I have committed an unpardonable sin.</i>

00:01:29.960 --> 00:01:31.830
<i>What have I done</i>

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:33.670
<i>to his innocent soul?</i>

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:36.590
<i>Something more filthy than rape,</i>

00:01:36.590 --> 00:01:38.800
<i>something more grisly than murder by poison...</i>

00:01:51.940 --> 00:01:53.310
Just who...

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:55.020
<i>Who</i> could you fall in love with...

00:01:55.030 --> 00:01:56.900
that'd make you end up like that...?

00:02:00.530 --> 00:02:03.780
Despite myself, I must admit at least
that your spirit, if nothing else, is strong.

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:17.670
I...

00:02:19.170 --> 00:02:22.800
have this thought every time I eat
something delicious or see a beautiful view:

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:25.300
that I want Kurahashi to taste what I'm tasting,

00:02:25.310 --> 00:02:26.720
or to see what I'm seeing.

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:27.850
Shouko...

00:02:28.310 --> 00:02:29.930
You must like him.

00:02:36.070 --> 00:02:37.650
<i>I sleep...</i>

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:42.450
<i>There is no peaceful rest for me, the one who sullied his love.</i>

00:02:46.580 --> 00:02:49.330
<i>I sleep, mindful of his betrayed heart,</i>

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:51.870
<i>bathed in sighs of ice...</i>

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:55.080
<i>and tormented by the endless nightmare of my sin...</i>

00:03:10.180 --> 00:03:13.100
<i>The day we spoke from our hearts</i>

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:14.730
<i>will never...</i>

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:16.810
<i>return.</i>

00:03:57.380 --> 00:03:58.280
I'm fine...

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:01.030
as long as I can see this through.

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:11.040
Eiri...

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:13.080
Eiri...

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:17.330
Cossette...

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:20.420
Good-bye, Eiri...

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:23.840
I'm sorry for everything that happened.

00:04:25.010 --> 00:04:26.090
This is good-bye.

00:04:29.560 --> 00:04:32.390
Oh, Aunt Hatsumi, are you sure I can stay over?

00:04:32.390 --> 00:04:35.440
Yes. Let's stay up until dawn and talk ourselves out.

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:36.520
Thanks.

00:04:36.520 --> 00:04:38.730
I'll stop by the convenience store.

00:04:38.730 --> 00:04:41.230
I do have sake and food for us too, you know.

00:04:41.230 --> 00:04:42.360
It's for underwear.

00:04:45.740 --> 00:04:47.160
She seemed to be in pain.

00:04:47.610 --> 00:04:50.450
I knew that she liked Kurahashi, but...

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:53.450
That's why I asked her to stay over, but...

00:04:53.870 --> 00:04:55.330
she seems to be okay now.

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:57.120
Shouko's back to her normal self.

00:04:57.120 --> 00:04:58.620
One would hope.

00:04:58.630 --> 00:04:59.420
What?

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:01.210
It was really bad a while ago.

00:05:01.670 --> 00:05:04.300
The negative emotions were very strong...

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:06.380
Hatred and bitterness...

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:09.260
so overwhelming they might invite misfortune...

00:05:21.110 --> 00:05:22.820
I loved you.

00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:49.300
This sucks. It suddenly started pouring.

00:05:54.010 --> 00:05:54.850
Cossette!

00:05:56.600 --> 00:05:57.770
Cossette!

00:05:57.770 --> 00:05:58.730
Where's Cossette?

00:06:01.240 --> 00:06:02.010
Eiri?

00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:05.020
Where is Cossette?

00:06:05.440 --> 00:06:06.280
Where is she?

00:06:06.570 --> 00:06:07.530
Cossette!

00:06:08.240 --> 00:06:09.320
Cossette!!!

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:12.950
Kurahashi?

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:17.910
Wh-What happened to your chest?

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:27.420
Kurahashi...

00:06:33.220 --> 00:06:34.010
Her room?

00:06:40.690 --> 00:06:41.980
Kurahashi...

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:43.520
Kurahashi!

00:07:00.460 --> 00:07:02.830
At first, you were only a tool.

00:07:03.380 --> 00:07:04.080
But

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:05.340
it's different now.

00:07:06.090 --> 00:07:07.710
To me, you're...

00:07:10.510 --> 00:07:12.680
I should have realized this sooner.

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:15.850
Even though you have inherited Marcello's soul,

00:07:15.850 --> 00:07:17.680
you are not him.

00:07:18.310 --> 00:07:20.850
And so, you get hurt.

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:25.980
I don't want to let you die.

00:07:25.980 --> 00:07:28.230
I don't want to rob you of your future.

00:07:28.730 --> 00:07:29.730
Eiri...

00:07:29.740 --> 00:07:31.280
please forget about me.

00:07:38.740 --> 00:07:40.080
Cossette!!!

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:02.390
Kurahashi...

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:24.370
It's no use, you enchanted, cursed antique...

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:25.460
You...

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:28.580
cannot reap the soul of Marcello that resides within me.

00:08:29.170 --> 00:08:32.170
You loved your former owner, Cossette–

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:34.380
so you hate and curse Marcello.

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:36.760
But, look at me!

00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:41.260
This evil soul of a beast

00:08:41.270 --> 00:08:44.600
tries to become a monster by engulfing even your curses!

00:08:45.440 --> 00:08:46.890
Cursed antique,

00:08:46.900 --> 00:08:48.860
do you still believe that I am Marcello?

00:08:49.860 --> 00:08:50.940
If you do,

00:08:51.190 --> 00:08:54.400
continue to curse me and the Marcello within me!

00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:58.600
But if I am not...

00:08:58.870 --> 00:09:01.080
take me to Cossette!

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:05.120
<i>I want to save her...</i>

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:07.580
<i>While there is yet life within me...</i>

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:10.790
<i>I want to save Cossette, who has
imprisoned herself in her hell of solitude!</i>

00:09:20.140 --> 00:09:21.180
Give me...

00:09:22.060 --> 00:09:23.850
Cossette's love!

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:53.290
Please take me...

00:09:53.300 --> 00:09:55.710
Take me to where Cossette is!

00:10:46.930 --> 00:11:01.990
Parting quiet lips, I sing a ballad.

00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:15.250
In the depths of my eyes,

00:11:15.960 --> 00:11:23.590
still gazing at the deep night,

00:11:33.020 --> 00:11:46.910
you whisper that you now know love for the first time.

00:11:47.030 --> 00:11:52.960
On the shores of sadness,

00:11:53.460 --> 00:12:03.680
the two of us fall in eternal love from time immemorial

00:12:03.970 --> 00:12:21.360
at the dawn of a slumbering dream that will not ever awaken.

00:12:57.020 --> 00:12:58.560
Why did you come?

00:12:58.560 --> 00:13:00.730
The few months that I spent with you...

00:13:01.070 --> 00:13:03.360
were the happiest of my life.

00:13:03.750 --> 00:13:04.550
I...

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:07.450
I was happy too.

00:13:08.070 --> 00:13:08.870
But

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:11.080
if I were to wish you happiness,

00:13:11.080 --> 00:13:13.200
I could only depart,

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:15.620
for there is no future for us.

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:16.750
It's enough that there is the present.

00:13:17.250 --> 00:13:18.710
I want to stay at your side.

00:13:18.790 --> 00:13:19.940
Will you?

00:13:20.040 --> 00:13:20.790
Stay here...

00:13:25.220 --> 00:13:26.130
Eiri!

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:42.100
Eiri...

00:13:42.270 --> 00:13:44.730
I'll grant you a wish as a sign of my appreciation.

00:13:44.740 --> 00:13:45.280
What?

00:13:45.650 --> 00:13:49.160
I'll do anything you want me to do.

00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:49.660
Tell me.

00:13:50.280 --> 00:13:50.950
A portrait...

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:52.740
I'd like to paint your portrait

00:13:53.120 --> 00:13:54.410
without anyone getting in the way.

00:13:55.450 --> 00:13:56.790
Gladly.

00:14:21.770 --> 00:14:23.060
Lets go.

00:14:23.070 --> 00:14:24.070
That is...?

00:14:24.480 --> 00:14:28.360
The only place where the living
and the dead may live together.

00:14:29.320 --> 00:14:32.410
Our isolated world that never changes and

00:14:32.410 --> 00:14:34.910
where none may trouble us.

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:45.630
How'd it go?

00:14:45.630 --> 00:14:46.670
Did you find him?

00:14:46.670 --> 00:14:47.760
No luck.

00:14:47.760 --> 00:14:48.920
And you?

00:14:48.920 --> 00:14:50.840
No luck here either.

00:14:50.920 --> 00:14:51.770
I see...

00:14:54.010 --> 00:14:55.430
Kurahashi...

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:17.080
I must go,

00:15:17.450 --> 00:15:21.000
even if I were to lose my sight.

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:23.330
And yet,

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:25.750
why do you try to make me say it?

00:15:26.590 --> 00:15:29.510
Why do you try to make me say that you are here

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:31.090
when I can no longer see you?

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:34.390
I...

00:15:34.600 --> 00:15:36.300
can no longer see you...

00:15:38.150 --> 00:15:38.870
Yes...

00:15:39.140 --> 00:15:40.680
even within me...

00:15:41.230 --> 00:15:42.560
and within other people...

00:15:42.940 --> 00:15:44.600
and within this stone...

00:15:46.150 --> 00:15:48.570
I can no longer see you.

00:15:50.240 --> 00:15:51.190
I am...

00:15:51.570 --> 00:15:52.450
alone.

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:01.250
Cossette, I'll hold that.

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:09.250
Eiri?

00:16:09.880 --> 00:16:11.920
Are you going to go before me?

00:16:11.920 --> 00:16:14.680
I'll go first because it's dangerous.

00:16:35.030 --> 00:16:37.450
"As though her soul had been taken away"?

00:16:37.450 --> 00:16:40.830
What do you mean by that?
It's not like you to say that, Dr. Hatsumi.

00:16:40.830 --> 00:16:43.290
Her primary physician is at a loss, too.

00:16:43.290 --> 00:16:45.750
She can breathe on her own
and is capable of involuntary reflex,

00:16:45.750 --> 00:16:47.750
but it's just that her brain waves are...

00:16:49.210 --> 00:16:51.000
What's wrong today?

00:16:51.010 --> 00:16:53.800
Kurahashi disappears, and then Shouko...

00:17:01.850 --> 00:17:02.560
Hey,

00:17:02.560 --> 00:17:03.560
Cossette...

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:07.350
Why did you accept me?

00:17:08.360 --> 00:17:11.820
Even though you had gone away for my sake...

00:17:12.110 --> 00:17:12.900
Why?

00:17:14.280 --> 00:17:15.280
Cossette?

00:17:17.910 --> 00:17:19.200
I wanted to test your feelings for me,

00:17:19.700 --> 00:17:21.030
Eiri.

00:17:21.490 --> 00:17:22.660
Test?

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:24.700
I'm a bad girl, aren't I?

00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:26.830
Sorry.

00:17:27.170 --> 00:17:27.960
It's okay.

00:17:38.220 --> 00:17:39.260
How distressing...

00:17:39.260 --> 00:17:41.800
This is a world that you and I made.

00:17:42.310 --> 00:17:44.020
It shouldn't break...

00:17:45.350 --> 00:17:47.480
I'm glad that it didn't hit you.

00:17:49.150 --> 00:17:53.270
Please impart to everyone his own death...

00:17:54.150 --> 00:17:55.230
To him,

00:17:55.280 --> 00:17:57.820
a death borne of that life

00:17:57.820 --> 00:18:00.740
which hid love, meaning, and suffering within itself...

00:18:02.330 --> 00:18:03.790
We cannot...

00:18:03.790 --> 00:18:05.540
become one.

00:18:40.070 --> 00:18:41.280
Dr. Hatsumi...

00:18:41.780 --> 00:18:42.870
I'll take your place.

00:18:42.870 --> 00:18:44.910
Go home and get some rest.

00:18:44.910 --> 00:18:45.950
Okay.

00:18:45.950 --> 00:18:48.080
Um, what about Kurahashi...

00:18:50.420 --> 00:18:51.120
I see.

00:18:53.250 --> 00:18:54.540
It's already been three days.

00:18:54.960 --> 00:18:57.710
Where is he and what could he be up to...

00:18:57.720 --> 00:18:59.050
when Shoukos in this state...?

00:19:00.880 --> 00:19:03.800
Isn't that a painting that was at the Kourandou?

00:19:03.800 --> 00:19:05.760
Did you bring it here, Miss Michiru?

00:19:05.760 --> 00:19:07.430
No, it wasn't me...

00:19:07.430 --> 00:19:08.770
I wonder when it got here.

00:19:15.610 --> 00:19:16.650
Here we are.

00:20:29.180 --> 00:20:30.430
Why...

00:20:30.430 --> 00:20:31.220
Why can't I...?

00:20:33.190 --> 00:20:34.600
What's wrong, Eiri?

00:20:40.320 --> 00:20:41.440
You draw so well!

00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:42.610
What?

00:20:45.320 --> 00:20:46.860
This one is wonderful, too.

00:20:46.870 --> 00:20:48.450
She looks exactly like me.

00:20:50.700 --> 00:20:53.120
You're really good at drawing, Eiri.

00:20:53.120 --> 00:20:54.160
Cossette...

00:20:54.160 --> 00:20:56.500
As good as Marcello.

00:20:59.380 --> 00:21:00.250
Eiri,

00:21:00.630 --> 00:21:02.550
please tell me you love me.

00:21:02.550 --> 00:21:03.670
Cossette...

00:21:03.670 --> 00:21:05.880
I know how you feel about me.

00:21:06.430 --> 00:21:08.010
But please tell me in words.

00:21:08.850 --> 00:21:10.760
Marcello would tell me,

00:21:10.760 --> 00:21:12.220
so you should too, Eiri...

00:21:14.020 --> 00:21:15.600
Now, please hurry.

00:21:16.600 --> 00:21:17.600
C-Cossette...?

00:21:30.080 --> 00:21:30.990
Eiri.

00:21:38.710 --> 00:21:39.710
I love you.

00:21:40.040 --> 00:21:43.210
No one loves your beauty more than I do.

00:21:43.530 --> 00:21:44.410
Eiri...

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:46.920
You are my precious treasure...

00:21:49.600 --> 00:21:51.510
if you are really Cossette.

00:21:53.930 --> 00:21:54.890
You...

00:21:54.890 --> 00:21:55.930
are not Cossette.

00:21:59.480 --> 00:22:02.070
You are the portrait Marcello painted...

00:22:42.840 --> 00:22:43.960
I trusted you

00:22:44.440 --> 00:22:46.400
that this is the world Cossette created.

00:22:47.150 --> 00:22:49.950
I guess it was the same for the enchanted and cursed antique.

00:22:49.950 --> 00:22:51.360
That is why it brought you here.

00:22:51.910 --> 00:22:53.660
Where is Cossette?

00:22:54.280 --> 00:22:55.620
What a cruel girl she is.

00:22:55.620 --> 00:22:59.410
She went away without saying anything.

00:22:59.420 --> 00:23:00.620
Without saying–

00:23:01.080 --> 00:23:03.290
I wonder what the first kiss...

00:23:03.290 --> 00:23:04.710
tasted like.

00:23:05.210 --> 00:23:06.210
Then,

00:23:06.210 --> 00:23:08.210
you were the Cossette I saw...

00:23:08.220 --> 00:23:10.680
Marcello told me.

00:23:10.680 --> 00:23:13.760
He said that I am the embodiment of perfect beauty

00:23:13.760 --> 00:23:16.720
and that I was mankind's ultimate treasure,

00:23:16.720 --> 00:23:19.230
illuminating the world far and wide, like a god.

00:23:19.730 --> 00:23:20.690
Eiri,

00:23:20.690 --> 00:23:23.270
you are also one who serves beauty.

00:23:23.270 --> 00:23:25.440
Then love me.

00:23:25.440 --> 00:23:27.730
Not Cossette, but me.

00:23:28.900 --> 00:23:31.400
That woman would be happier that way, too.

00:23:39.620 --> 00:23:41.410
Now, now, Eiri...

00:23:43.460 --> 00:23:45.790
Why do you obsess over that girl?

00:23:45.790 --> 00:23:49.130
She has no right to be loved by you.

00:23:49.130 --> 00:23:51.510
It is the fate of one chosen by beauty

00:23:51.510 --> 00:23:53.970
to serve beauty and die for beauty.

00:23:53.970 --> 00:23:57.640
She should have rejoiced at being
chosen as the model for me, the work of art,

00:23:57.640 --> 00:24:01.560
and died on her own without having to involve Marcello.

00:24:03.060 --> 00:24:03.780
But...

00:24:03.900 --> 00:24:05.940
she resisted that.

00:24:05.940 --> 00:24:07.860
She cursed Marcello.

00:24:07.860 --> 00:24:10.030
Cossette is not beautiful.

00:24:10.030 --> 00:24:10.940
Where...

00:24:10.940 --> 00:24:11.900
is Cossette?

00:24:25.040 --> 00:24:26.040
Cossette!

00:25:18.260 --> 00:25:19.260
Cossette!

00:25:35.030 --> 00:25:36.530
Don't you understand?

00:25:37.360 --> 00:25:40.120
Eiri, you cannot surpass me.

00:25:40.580 --> 00:25:43.200
I, who was created by Marcello...

00:25:43.200 --> 00:25:44.910
You cannot overcome me, the cliff called beauty.

00:25:48.710 --> 00:25:51.460
I am the true Cossette.

00:25:51.460 --> 00:25:53.590
From the moment I was born,

00:25:53.590 --> 00:25:55.630
she became a fake.

00:25:56.130 --> 00:25:59.930
Beautiful things are the world's only truth!

00:26:01.140 --> 00:26:03.430
You are free to believe whatever you want.

00:26:04.220 --> 00:26:05.600
But I'm different.

00:26:06.730 --> 00:26:09.150
That is not what I wish to paint!

00:26:13.110 --> 00:26:15.070
Marcello's atelier... where is it?

00:26:27.540 --> 00:26:28.670
I will not accept them...

00:26:29.830 --> 00:26:31.080
Marcello's "beauty"...

00:26:32.090 --> 00:26:33.460
Marcello's paintings...

00:26:34.760 --> 00:26:36.130
Marcello's love...

00:27:20.630 --> 00:27:22.510
Stop that, Eiri.

00:27:22.510 --> 00:27:25.140
You don't need to do anything.

00:27:27.270 --> 00:27:29.930
Don't do anything; don't think of anything;

00:27:29.940 --> 00:27:31.770
just serve and obey me,

00:27:31.770 --> 00:27:34.440
walking along the path I light for you.

00:27:34.440 --> 00:27:36.770
I will not allow you to walk before me!

00:27:47.040 --> 00:27:48.410
To me...

00:27:48.410 --> 00:27:50.200
art elevates humanity.

00:27:52.750 --> 00:27:54.460
Art leads to happiness.

00:28:05.890 --> 00:28:08.100
Cossette was killed by Marcello.

00:28:08.640 --> 00:28:09.930
I will not

00:28:09.930 --> 00:28:10.930
accept that man's art!

00:28:21.070 --> 00:28:22.150
Why?

00:28:37.800 --> 00:28:38.920
Help me...

00:28:39.920 --> 00:28:41.420
Marcello!

00:28:42.680 --> 00:28:44.260
Help me...

00:29:15.330 --> 00:29:16.620
Kurahashi...

00:29:20.920 --> 00:29:22.050
Mataki...

00:29:34.020 --> 00:29:35.180
Eiri...

00:29:36.400 --> 00:29:39.190
Your art is much...

00:29:39.690 --> 00:29:41.190
much warmer than Marcello's art.

00:30:25.610 --> 00:30:26.990
Shouko...

00:30:30.030 --> 00:30:33.280
I was dreaming about Kurahashi.

00:30:34.540 --> 00:30:36.870
He said he'll come back...

00:30:37.670 --> 00:30:39.960
because he wants to draw more.

00:30:39.960 --> 00:30:41.000
I see.

00:30:48.380 --> 00:30:49.720
Shouko...

00:30:52.350 --> 00:30:54.930
Everything should become one...

00:30:56.060 --> 00:30:57.890
everything that is pure...

00:30:59.230 --> 00:31:01.560
Just as a bird has two wings...

00:31:02.900 --> 00:31:04.190
just as...

00:31:04.730 --> 00:31:06.030
the sky ind the sea

00:31:06.030 --> 00:31:07.490
will eventually become one...

00:31:57.170 --> 00:32:01.540
Listening quietly to the singing

00:32:01.630 --> 00:32:07.550
that secretly flows down my way,

00:32:08.430 --> 00:32:12.810
we share the white sigh of the moon

00:32:12.890 --> 00:32:18.690
with a sweet kiss

00:32:19.760 --> 00:32:24.720
as though we're lovers.

00:32:25.240 --> 00:32:28.110
Hold me closer.

00:32:28.200 --> 00:32:31.950
I feel as though my love is supported

00:32:32.120 --> 00:32:38.270
by the depth of the wounds I must atone for.

00:32:38.560 --> 00:32:43.210
So for now, I want to thaw your frozen heart

00:32:43.300 --> 00:32:50.140
with pain, rather than kindness.

00:32:50.640 --> 00:32:54.510
I will always be close to you

00:32:54.600 --> 00:33:00.650
like a shadow you cannot elude.

00:33:00.980 --> 00:33:05.650
The teardrops you let fall

00:33:06.190 --> 00:33:13.910
adorn my fingers like jewels, shining brightly.

00:33:38.510 --> 00:33:42.110
We will surely go together

00:33:42.320 --> 00:33:48.530
beyond these meadows that glisten so brilliantly.

00:33:48.800 --> 00:33:53.450
So for now, I will cling to the strength of our entwined fingers,

00:33:53.780 --> 00:34:00.330
and not let go of your solitude

00:34:00.920 --> 00:34:04.710
because we will be able to find

00:34:04.920 --> 00:34:10.920
the flicker of light, even deep in the darkness.

00:34:11.170 --> 00:34:16.030
Searching for the distant jeweled slumber,

00:34:16.320 --> 00:34:24.440
I have faith in the strength to go beyond the night.
